# Environment variables used by the backend (ASP.NET Core maps "__" to ":" in configuration keys).
# This file contains NO real credentials. Copy values into your shell, your IDE launch profile,
# or `dotnet user-secrets` (preferred for local development). Never commit real values.
# The backend does not load .env files automatically.

# --- Database (PostgreSQL) -> configuration section "Database" ---
Database__Host=localhost
Database__Port=5432
Database__Database=my_app_dev
Database__Username=
Database__Password=

# --- CORS: exact browser origins allowed to call the API (production must list real origins) ---
# Cors__AllowedOrigins__0=http://localhost:5173

# --- ASP.NET Core runtime ---
# ASPNETCORE_ENVIRONMENT=Development
# ASPNETCORE_URLS=http://localhost:5000

# --- Mobile app ---
# The mobile app has no environment variables. The API address is set in
# mobile/src/constants/config.ts (API_HOST_OVERRIDE for physical devices).
